		</section><section id="text-3" class="widget widget_text"><div class="widgettitle">NOTE:</div>			<div class="textwidget"><p>Under Florida law, e-mail addresses are public records. If you do not want your e-mail address released in response to a public records request, do not send electronic mail to this entity. Instead, contact this office by phone or in writing.</p>
